    "1": {
      "uid": 1,
      "key": [
        "Requiem",
        "Remus's Requiem",
        "final symphony"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Remus: The Requiem",
      "content": "Remus's last symphony, the Grand Symphony's self-destruction order, which he gave to Scylla. His plan was to sacrifice himself to unleash it while Scylla entered the Domus Aurea to control the primordial energy and restore the Remurians. The plan failed when Scylla was sealed, and Remuria sank. The Requiem's power remained in Scylla's Ichor body.",
