    "2": {
      "uid": 2,
      "key": [
        "Sybilla",
        "Golden Bees",
        "Golden Bee"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Remus: Sybilla and the Golden Bees",
      "content": "The former envoy who guarded the Irminsul at the forgotten city Remus found. She predicted he would found a nation whose passion for justice would cause its end, but considered avoiding the fall futile because civilisations rise and fall by the law of Fortuna. She nonetheless pointed him toward Egeria and eventually gave her life to create Phobos.",
