      "key": [
        "Scylla",
        "Prince of Vishaps",
        "fell dragon"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Remus: Scylla",
      "content": "Remus's first adversary and later friend. After thirty days and nights of battle at Egeria's prison, the exhausted pair talked, and Scylla let Remus pass and later joined his cause. Remurian tradition remembers him as an evil \"fell dragon\" who betrayed Remus; in the Traveler's visions he was sealed by Boethius while trying to carry out Remus's plan.",
