      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Remus: Harmosts",
      "content": "Remus shared governance with four humans of great capability, called the Four Harmosts; two were Boethius and Cassiodor. Boethius pursued domination of non-Remurians; Cassiodor was freed from the Symphony by Remus to lead the other Remurians.",
