      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Remus: Remuria",
      "content": "The empire Remus founded over the waters of ancient Fontaine, with its capital divided into the outer city Machimos and the inner Capitolium, with the Domus Aurea at its heart. It fell in a single destructive wave when the Requiem was released. See its own entry for the place.",
